Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.02,0:01:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he was CP9,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:02:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the agents they have now are the\Nstrongest the world has ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.82,0:02:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even among them, Rob Lucci was the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These pirates are too powerful!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.22,0:02:10.06,Title,,0,0,240,,{\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(600,0)\t(555,600,\1a&H00&)}{Complete}Utter Defeat
Dialogue: 2,0:02:04.22,0:02:10.06,Title,,0,0,240,,{\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(600,0)}{Complete}Utter Defeat
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.28,0:02:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.76,0:02:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy won!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.94,0:02:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you had his words.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.18,0:02:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You finally beat him. Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody head to the escape ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.50,0:02:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're getting out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.22,0:02:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.54,0:03:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.06,0:03:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your crew keep it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone can hear us! Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We want him to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.28,0:03:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, those voices,\Nwhose are they? Unknown!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.26,0:03:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're coming in from somewhere\Nthrough a transponder snail, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.14,0:03:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.28,0:03:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.19,0:03:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.48,0:03:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They still think we're dead, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.14,0:03:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna blow it! It's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.30,0:03:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.86,0:03:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't those the pirates we shot\Ndown on the shore by the front gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds like it, but sir, we saw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:04:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all fell over the cliff, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.14,0:04:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They couldn't have survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.68,0:04:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.46,0:04:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop pushing, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.32,0:04:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.96,0:04:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rope's gonna break!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.64,0:04:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.98,0:05:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Galley-La robes never break! Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.42,0:05:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, I told you to keep it quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.50,0:05:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.72,0:05:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody made it! That\Nwas close! The Giants!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.72,0:05:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They took all the cannon\Nfire for us! Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.94,0:05:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gosh, they're a stubborn bunch, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hey, at least they're alive! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.62,0:05:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sodom and Gomorrah are okay, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's not safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.76,0:05:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those battleships will be coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.76,0:05:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get moving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.26,0:05:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got our escape plan all figured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.52,0:05:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.43,0:05:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.35,0:05:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's all leave this place alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.96,0:05:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you again soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.14,0:05:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to head out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.82,0:05:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys climb up first!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.54,0:05:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Blood. Rushing to head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, climb!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.98,0:05:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, everybody, get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.30,0:05:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna fall! Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.20,0:05:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop shoving!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.28,0:05:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dummies!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:06:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't worried about you at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.22,0:06:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They made it, they're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.22,0:06:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy those idiots are okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.56,0:06:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agreed. Good for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a relief, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.96,0:06:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you die here, it won't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.82,0:06:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, should we hurry\Nover to the main gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.60,0:06:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.56,0:06:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.20,0:06:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got a duty to carry out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.12,0:06:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take all of you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.16,0:06:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.84,0:06:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oni Giri!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.58,0:06:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Convenient!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.20,0:06:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snow Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.02,0:07:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our target is Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.96,0:07:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's on the first column.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.36,0:07:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right. Understood, sir. But he's... Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't seem to be moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.54,0:07:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.28,0:07:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, he...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.24,0:07:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He appears to be severely wounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.60,0:07:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.06,0:07:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.64,0:07:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.40,0:07:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get the hell over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.86,0:07:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't escape, we're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.06,0:07:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you damn it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use your powers to slingshot\Nyourself over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.46,0:07:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll carry you the rest of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded by Snow\Nbattleships on all sides!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.88,0:08:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we stay here, we're gonna be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.18,0:08:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems the pirates planned to\Nescape using the stolen escort ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.24,0:08:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.64,0:08:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.00,0:08:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body won't. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.44,0:08:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body won't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.64,0:08:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't move?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.06,0:08:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.02,0:08:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just beat Luffy, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.24,0:08:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we already saved Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.36,0:08:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing left to do is run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.76,0:08:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.52,0:08:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take the ship to Luffy's!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.44,0:09:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll grab him and get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.12,0:09:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone move! Get on board!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.38,0:09:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.29,0:09:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's our escape ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.24,0:09:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's hopeless!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.94,0:09:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're completely surrounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ship was our only way out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.08,0:09:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.08,0:09:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kokoro, Chimney, Gonbe, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.22,0:09:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.66,0:09:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.44,0:10:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.64,0:10:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.32,0:10:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.23,0:10:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.24,0:10:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.50,0:10:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.41,0:10:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was something I had to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.30,0:10:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're pretty screwed right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.04,0:10:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought they'd attack us\Nas long as we still had Robin here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.80,0:10:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was sure the bridge and\Nthe ship would be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.70,0:10:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's far enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.94,0:10:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.85,0:10:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Release the old lady and\Nthe little gorilla arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time for any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.64,0:10:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kermit, can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.40,0:11:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does this always happen to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.74,0:11:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go to them in the second kettlebell. Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.24,0:11:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.14,0:11:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.50,0:11:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.46,0:11:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.82,0:11:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.79,0:12:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They took out the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.90,0:12:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're stuck on this column!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.30,0:12:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These bastards have got us cornered!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.30,0:12:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing else we can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.78,0:12:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.78,0:12:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then this is where we'll make our stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.86,0:12:12.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.77,0:12:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.70,0:12:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll just keep sending more\Nand more of those captains at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All ships, prepare to open\Nfire at the first column!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the Conis take aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.64,0:12:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eliminate Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.38,0:12:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to do something. Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.82,0:12:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad. No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.74,0:13:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No good at this distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.10,0:13:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I can do is grab him\Nand throw him into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.24,0:13:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad news, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.86,0:13:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat may have won the fight, but\Nnow he's so weak, he can't get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.26,0:13:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat! No! Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.00,0:13:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.88,0:13:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand up, throw head!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.80,0:13:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.44,0:13:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirate guy, run! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.42,0:13:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.33,0:13:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.76,0:13:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, you've got to do\Nsomething right now, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.66,0:13:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.68,0:13:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw head!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.78,0:13:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.96,0:13:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw head!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.62,0:13:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.92,0:13:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is again. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.92,0:14:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're trying to kill yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.12,0:14:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop spacing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.52,0:14:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's not the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whose voice is this, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.18,0:14:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.24,0:14:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the same voice that I heard before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.36,0:14:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.78,0:14:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.69,0:14:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those voices? It's my guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.52,0:14:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not what\NI'm talking about here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.94,0:14:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard it for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.22,0:14:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.22,0:14:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.66,0:14:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look below.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.22,0:15:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming from...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.90,0:15:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over here. Below?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.90,0:15:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.14,0:15:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell? That voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.92,0:15:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says look below. Who does?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.44,0:15:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.32,0:15:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All ships open fire on the\Nfirst column in Stride, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.12,0:15:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commencing at five.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.14,0:15:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.58,0:15:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jump in the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.54,0:15:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.12,0:15:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.30,0:15:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, can you still\Nthrow Luffy into the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.18,0:15:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.09,0:15:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.94,0:15:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jump in the sea won't help a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.86,0:16:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.92,0:16:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She came to rescue us!\NJump! It'll be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.70,0:16:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still got one more friend here! Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.72,0:16:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper! Did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.96,0:16:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, see and float.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.68,0:16:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.28,0:16:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Delphinium!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.14,0:16:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.92,0:16:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is Robin doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.10,0:16:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.96,0:16:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.58,0:16:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.78,0:16:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.24,0:16:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.82,0:16:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.60,0:16:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.32,0:16:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of the pirates are\Njumping into the sea! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.96,0:17:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way those idiots\Nwill survive in these waters!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.56,0:17:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.54,0:17:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those Straw Hats are\Ncompletely out of their minds!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go back, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.00,0:17:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to the seas of adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get on board the Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.82,0:17:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.73,0:17:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Merry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.66,0:18:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came to get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.86,0:18:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.34,0:18:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they jump in the ocean,\Nthey're just going to drown!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.32,0:18:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they have Devil Fruit\Nusers with them as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.06,0:18:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's suicide!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.94,0:18:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.36,0:18:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that their ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.62,0:18:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be! See?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.18,0:18:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It even has a Straw Hat's fire flag on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell did it stick\Npast all our battleships?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.28,0:18:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are,\Npal, but I sure owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.18,0:18:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.04,0:19:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.58,0:19:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not wrong, just strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.16,0:19:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rope ladder got dropped down, but\Nit doesn't look like anyone's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.82,0:19:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.94,0:19:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.44,0:19:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.78,0:19:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, can't you swim\Non your own, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.74,0:19:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alrighty, up you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.62,0:19:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope you enjoyed the ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.84,0:19:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin! Yoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.62,0:19:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leap into my arms, darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.92,0:19:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.80,0:19:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're on the ferry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.42,0:19:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're back on the ferry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.00,0:19:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, Barry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.24,0:19:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you so much! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.26,0:19:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.17,0:19:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sweet Mary is still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.98,0:19:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did she make it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:20:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could give you a\Nhug, Mary, but I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.84,0:20:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.75,0:20:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw the ship drop into the ocean myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.30,0:20:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The question is, who sailed it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.84,0:20:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll figure it out later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.04,0:20:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just get us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.95,0:20:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.87,0:20:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.78,0:20:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.69,0:20:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.61,0:20:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.60,0:20:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you want me to do, Nami Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.06,0:20:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.58,0:20:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought those battleships were\Ngoing to blow me up for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.86,0:20:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Robin, you saved me. Thanks a...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.40,0:20:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, leave everything to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.80,0:21:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, everyone, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.90,0:21:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.68,0:21:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nice, but save the sappy stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till after we escape, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You take that back, you heartless bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.74,0:21:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.50,0:21:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we sit around, we're just gonna\Nend up dead and stupid I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.32,0:21:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apologize to Robin! That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.54,0:21:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of you, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.82,0:21:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, Chopper, you're moving again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.88,0:21:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.79,0:21:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention\Nit, I guess I am moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.28,0:21:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was afraid I'd never get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.10,0:21:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now apologize to Robin already!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.92,0:21:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give up yet? No! Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.76,0:22:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.58,0:22:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys ready to move? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.48,0:22:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put it together, you idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.14,0:22:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you just gonna stand\Nthere and let them get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.98,0:22:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're gonna escape anyway, we\Nmight as well blow up Nico Robin, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.94,0:22:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.85,0:22:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we're supposed to\Ncapture her alive, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.10,0:22:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tragic, I know, but that's\Nwhat Aokiji said to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.06,0:22:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, all ships, prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.62,0:22:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Admiral Aokiji said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.14,0:22:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, man, take aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.26,0:22:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All ships, prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.78,0:22:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Revenge, prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.34,0:22:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so I lied, but that's\Nbetter than letting them get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.74,0:22:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make them pay for what they've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you load those\Ncannonballs any faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.12,0:22:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want them to get high?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.16,0:22:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spawn them still alive, huh? That sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.86,0:22:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.18,0:22:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catch the wind from\Nstarboard and head east!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.46,0:22:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't, we're completely surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.24,0:22:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All those big scary cannons and\Nthey're aiming straight at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.38,0:23:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this range with that many ships,\Nthere's no way they're gonna miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.08,0:23:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.86,0:23:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.56,0:23:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are they firing at each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.22,0:23:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There ain't can't be that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.18,0:23:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.46,0:23:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are you waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.64,0:23:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.66,0:23:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like the cannons just\Ndid that on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.70,0:23:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make such stupid excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.20,0:23:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Change cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.70,0:23:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.44,0:23:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're coming straight at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.18,0:23:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.50,0:23:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is madness!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.88,0:23:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.36,0:23:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look over there, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.46,0:23:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Gates of Justice are\Nclosing for some reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.56,0:23:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gate can't block the current anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.40,0:23:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With these whirlpools around, we\Nwon't be able to control the rudder!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.52,0:23:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's why our aim was so bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.56,0:24:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get sucked in!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.42,0:24:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing keeps going from back to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.20,0:24:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put out the fire! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.00,0:24:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to jump ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.96,0:24:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.87,0:24:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those damn fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.10,0:24:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did they close the gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.46,0:24:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry the hell up and open it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.62,0:24:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.80,0:24:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The operation lever is on\Nthe bridge of hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.48,0:24:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't our fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.12,0:24:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That turned out better than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.36,0:24:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, is that what you\Ndid while you were gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.68,0:24:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.20,0:24:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured it'd take more than just\Nguts to get out of here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.82,0:24:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.88,0:24:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll like my hero forever, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.52,0:24:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you a genius or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.08,0:24:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a little early to be kissing his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.98,0:24:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These whirlpools are\Na problem for us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.24,0:24:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.15,0:24:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.07,0:24:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.98,0:24:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.26,0:24:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as we're together, there's no\Nsea that the Going Merry can't cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.00,0:24:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.91,0:25:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so cool, Nami! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.78,0:25:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go for it, Navigator!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.46,0:25:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hold them off while\NI find a path for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.94,0:25:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.36,0:25:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One-sword-style, 36-caliber-6!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.20,0:25:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.11,0:25:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you idiots keep missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.34,0:25:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.60,0:25:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got less a million cannons\Nfiring at that stupid thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.90,0:25:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just one little ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.02,0:25:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're coming your way, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.40,0:25:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got him here! No way! I\Nmissed one! Sanji, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.26,0:25:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pause, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.76,0:25:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahh, guys, save some for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.52,0:25:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to fight him too!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.44,0:25:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.35,0:25:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna squirm him to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.82,0:25:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hate to break it to you, Captain,\Nbut I think this one is our battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.24,0:25:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.15,0:25:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.20,0:25:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't take a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.98,0:26:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make these guys go me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.30,0:26:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just gotta get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.14,0:26:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give a medal to\Nanyone who can hit them!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.38,0:26:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One shot is all attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.88,0:26:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All ships concentrate attacks\Non their back deck! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.14,0:26:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.62,0:26:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't tell me what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.74,0:26:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.08,0:26:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.08,0:26:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, I think they're coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.14,0:26:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never let us down, huh, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.18,0:26:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we needed you after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.30,0:26:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You people are monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.38,0:26:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.68,0:27:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.90,0:27:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The path to victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.04,0:27:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, helm hard to port!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.78,0:27:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nine o 'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.69,0:27:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, you got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.10,0:27:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're pulling towards the waterfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.10,0:27:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.24,0:27:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shoot them!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.60,0:27:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.28,0:27:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How hard can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.06,0:27:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save that damn ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.38,0:27:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're riding the\Ncurrent of the whirlpool.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.74,0:27:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.65,0:27:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't keep up. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.66,0:27:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get to be useful, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.54,0:27:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it, reindeer dude. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.36,0:27:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.28,0:27:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.02,0:27:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.72,0:27:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.76,0:27:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.32,0:27:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had the power of Enies Lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.42,0:27:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power of CP9.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.04,0:27:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I even had the power of a bastard call.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.72,0:27:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They practically burned\Nthe whole island down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.38,0:27:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, even after all that,\Neven after all I've done,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.78,0:27:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take a single woman away\Nfrom a tiny band of riffraff!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.24,0:27:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.78,0:28:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chief Spandam!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.02,0:28:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.38,0:28:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clutch!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.04,0:28:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez, Chaka, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.66,0:28:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.20,0:29:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that settles that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.12,0:29:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Franky, it's time\Nto do your thing! You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.44,0:29:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready, kids, because\Nthis is going to be wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.42,0:29:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bluff their hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.66,0:29:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get out of the portal!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.86,0:29:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, this might\Nbang up your ship a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.94,0:29:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.80,0:29:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.72,0:29:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.96,0:29:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pirate ship is flying?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.92,0:29:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to top that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.00,0:29:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our cannons can't reach that high.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.10,0:29:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think that Mary's an\Nordinary ship, then you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.04,0:29:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's flown through the air once\Nand she can do it again no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.40,0:29:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Special Attack: Super Fox Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.62,0:29:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a smokescreen!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.18,0:29:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put those pirates! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.32,0:29:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.76,0:29:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.67,0:30:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's taking all we've\Ngot just to stay afloat!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.60,0:30:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta get out of this whirlpool first!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.46,0:30:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maintain fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.37,0:30:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.56,0:30:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the straw\Nhats are safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.96,0:30:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.87,0:30:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.58,0:31:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Puffing Tom!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.46,0:31:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're heading home!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.78,0:31:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize you were here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.06,0:31:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't given up the chase yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.22,0:31:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear it won't end like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.54,0:31:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must maintain our dignity as the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.38,0:31:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, as the World Government.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.44,0:31:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll bring down the\NStraw Hats at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.82,0:31:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin is in the palm of our hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.90,0:31:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let her escape\Nagain after all we've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.62,0:31:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Admiral,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.53,0:31:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,allow us to call in reinforcements and\Nwe'll overtake them as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.18,0:31:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't bother. But, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.96,0:31:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the force that we command\Nwith a Buster Call
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.22,0:31:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is as powerful as an\Nentire nation's military.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.30,0:31:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, look at the state of our fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.08,0:31:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at Enies Lobby burning to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.76,0:31:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The situation is obvious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.32,0:31:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day is lost, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.26,0:31:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been utterly defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.10,0:31:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure you want to sit up\Non top of that cheap head?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.28,0:31:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.38,0:31:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the captain's seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.14,0:32:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.64,0:32:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful not to fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.12,0:32:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.03,0:32:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help, Monster Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.30,0:32:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.36,0:32:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And thank you, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.24,0:32:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We never would have made\Nit if you weren't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.46,0:32:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was pretty surprised when you showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.28,0:32:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when I think about it, you've\Nalways been there to protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.78,0:32:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've always counted on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.04,0:32:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm just happy you've\Nbeen part of the team, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.18,0:32:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a good friend to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.58,0:32:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to spoil the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.28,0:32:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, you guys did some\Ncrazy stuff back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.46,0:32:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think the\Ngovernment's gonna let you
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.22,0:32:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,off that easy after you burned\Ndown their flag. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.42,0:32:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't feel like a big deal to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.32,0:32:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason I did\Nany of that was because
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.92,0:32:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they took our friend and I wanted her back
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.18,0:32:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We couldn't have done what\Nwe did without your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.76,0:32:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So thanks a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.46,0:32:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, like you said it wasn't\Nreally that big a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.28,0:32:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just do what I had to do
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.22,0:33:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Point is we're all together coming\Nback in one piece and this fight was
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.76,0:33:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
